{"evt":"summary_set","id":"note:note-mqqwu05983g","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","summary":"Task #2 hooks code_edges traversal into lib/search/memory-search.js as expandCodeStructure(), called after the code_node direct-RAG (tier 'code') seeds are built and sorted. Seeds = cosine code_node hits already in ragResults. For each seed code:&lt;file&gt;#&lt;name&gt;: callees/imports-out = edges where from_file === seed.file and to is a code_node key (surface those to nodes); callers/imports-in = edges where to === seed.key (surface code_nodes defined in the calling from_file). Caps: seedLimit 5, perSeedLimit 8, totalLimit 24, callerSymbolsPerFile 3. Purely additive — new rows get tier 'code' via 'code-structural' with a tiny fixed score (0.0008, below cosine floor) so cosine hits never reorder/drop; already-present nodes only get annotated (code_expanded). Reads overlay.code_edges + overlay.code_nodes (both populated at the memorySearch call site). Mirrors the existing expandStructuralContext pattern.","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-23T18:41:06.141Z"}
